  {
    "episode_id": 50736,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50736.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "One of the things that you have been able to do over recently and over the last many years, nine terms in Congress, is you've been able to get a lot of money towards environmental challenges, coastal resiliency. You had two major storms a year ago in Maine that had a big impact on your state. Climate resiliency is a huge issue. Tell us about the grants that you're able to get and tell me if this money will spend.",
