        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Storm impacts validate the urgency of climate resiliency investments.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressional experience correlates with ability to secure federal resources.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker is responsible for managing or influencing grant disbursement.",
        "confidence": 0.84
