    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50736.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "But it's a rite of passage in a community like mine and, you know, young kids grow up, you know, going fishing as soon as they can run an outboard engine themselves. And it's a really important part of what we do.",
