    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50736.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 38,
    "turn_text": "Maine is not in the center of the United States. It is in many ways sort of a remote state. But what can other states learn from Maine? I mean, is it applicable to what's going on in Maine? Is it applicable to other places in the nation?",
