        "text": "States with geographic remoteness can still possess valuable policy or cultural insights.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Other states face challenges similar enough to those in Maine to allow for transferable learning.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that regional differences do not preclude broader applicability of local experiences.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The value of a state’s experience should be judged based on its potential usefulness elsewhere.",
