    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "later on. But first, this sort of ties into it. You have something before Congress, the Bipartisan Protect Our Clothes from PFAS Act. This is sort of surprising. As I understand it, and I'm sure you'll explain this better than I, right now if you import clothes with an inorganic, waterproofing material. It's cheaper than if you have inorganic materials. Am I close?",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
