  {
    "episode_id": 50736,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50736.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 52,
    "turn_text": "Basically, I mean, we're trying to eradicate PFAS from our clothing. Most people have heard of it now. It's a forever chemical. It's not good for your health. It's not good for the soil. And many of the clothing manufacturers are trying to change over to a less toxic chemical. The way our tariff laws work, and we're all getting an education in tariffs",
