    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/5/0/50736.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 61,
    "turn_text": "Well, so the other issue that I understand that you've been very active in is something called fast fashion. What is fast fashion?",
