    "turn_idx": 93,
    "turn_text": "Oh, they should speak up. Absolutely. I mean, we take to heart everything everyone calls and tells us or the people stop and tell me on the street that we hear in a meeting with people. This is your government. You get the government that you participate in. And I think the more you sit on the sidelines or, you know, just watch it on TV and yell at the monitor, the worse it is. So just participate, be engaged. Let us know what you think. It makes a huge difference.",
